divine (sgamer) said welcome to redspot. This vertion of redspot is being developed by arman izadi, mahdi saadat, and mohammadhosein ghezelsofla. Version 0.91. Type /rules to see the rules. Message of the day: empty colas now fixed! you can thro one of them only in 20 sec! You can now move players with bike when they are 0 step from you!
A few bugs were fixed in relation to empty cola, thank you Ghaderi!
The game link: http://5.39.125.254/redspot.zip
You can't go afk while you are in store anymore.
Added satellite bomb locater. Use that to understand where is your satellite bombs! But remember, this has a test sound.
Added killing ground map. When you are newbie, type /baddlefield to go to baddlefield map, or type /newbie to go to killing ground.
You can remain in the killingground map just 30 minutes. 
Added /report command, if you want to call developers quickly, use it. If there's any developer or admin around, they'll see your mesage.
The bug of hammer, shotgun, handgun and machinegun has been fixed. We don't have machine gun now.
Random inventory Also added, you have 3 random weapons and some more item at your default inventory.
If you open a corpse having corpse bomb, you'll go to dream for some seconds, and you will see the items you lost!
The claymore won't kill a linklost player anymore.
combo arena and melee arena map added, type /marena or /carena to join to melee arena or combo arena,  and type /leavearena to leav. Remember, when you type /marena, or /carena you need to go offline and come back to be in arena, and You also need to do the same to get back. You couldn't go afk in any of the above arenas.
The canisters are now usable with hands.
Friends please, please, and please, learn the game and do not call each other cheaters. Just because one of you is stronger does not mean that he/she is a cheater. The drs and thc teams have been playing for at least 3 months. So if you want to get power, play! as much as you can
We like others, have a lot of enemies. Most  of them are trying to destroy us. Remember. We never help anyone with items or moves or anything like that because we do not want to destroy ourselves. We dont need to use admin commands. When we know that if we use them, we lose players, why should we use them? 1-17-2021, 8:34:32 PM
